  "resume": "This document is a sound recording of a parliamentary question session in the Swiss National Council on December 15, 2008, concerning the Ilisu Dam project and Switzerland's export risk guarantee. It features National Councillor Marlies Bänziger posing a question to Federal Councillor Doris Leuthard and Chiara Simoneschi-Cortesi. The exchange focuses on Swiss policy regarding the controversial Ilisu Dam construction in Turkey."
 },
